
build UI forms based on metadata - similar to SAP dynamic UI rendering pages 

techstack
- frontend: react, material ui
- backend: python fast API 
- database: mongodb / postgresql (suggest best database to support store metadata and dynamic form data)

functionality
- metadata UI page to collect dynamic UI page fields, actions, rules
- create dynamic UI page based on metadata with event handling, loading options for select boxes, handle all type of html controls like input, radio, checkbox, button, selectbox, autocomplete, etc
- create 2 routes, 1st one metadata UI page, 2nd one dynamic UI with dropdown with list of available metadata records from database 
- connect to python from react
- use react state management (redux toolkit)
- create endpoints in python fast api with best practices 
- python connects to mongodb / postgresql based on suggestion to store / retrieve metadata and store dynamic form submitted data 
- python should follow MVC structure, dependency injection, model level validations, cross origin setup, filter to authenticate / authorize requests (for now return true)

Metadata:
- _id: string / number
- label: string
- description: string
- startDate: date
- endDate: date 
- dataVersioning: boolean
- metadataVersion: boolean;
- template: UITemplate;
- status: ENUM_Status(1 - ACTIVE, 2 - INACTIVE, 3 - HOLD, 4 - DRAFT);
- apiVisibility: ENUM_ApiVisibility(1 - ALLOW, 2 - NOT_ALLOWED);
- fields: Field[]

UITemplate:
- _id: string / number
- label: string
- description: string
- status: ENUM_Status(1 - ACTIVE, 2 - INACTIVE, 3 - HOLD, 4 - DRAFT)
- template: string (I want to save UI template format here either in json / yml / suggest better option)

Field:
- _id: string / number
- label: string
- helpText: string
- defaultValue: string
- datatype: ENUM_Datatype(NUMBER, STRING, DATE, TIME, DATETIME, PICKLIST, USER, TRANSLATABLE);
- when datatype = NUMBER -> show below on UI page
- precision: number;
- trailingZeros: number;
- when datatype = DATETIME, TIME -> show below on UI page
- showSeconds: boolean;
- when datatype = STRING -> show below on UI page
- minLength: number;
- maxLength: number;
- when datatype = PICKLIST -> show below on UI page
- picklistDatasource: Metadata
- picklistDatasourceFiled: Metadata.Filed - show only after selection of picklistDatasource
- picklistDatasourceFilterBy: Metadata.Filed[] (multiselect) - show only after selection of picklistDatasource
- picklistDatsourceFormat: string; - show only after selection of picklistDatasource
- when datatype = USER -> show below on UI page
- includeInactiveUsers: boolean;
- when datatype = TRANSLATABLE-> show below on UI page
- country: Country[];
- state: State[];
- required: boolean;
- showHistory: boolean;
- maskValueOnUi: boolean;
